{"title":"防止 AI 味儿","html":"<main><div class=\"catalog-page aif-catalog-page\"><div class=\"catalog-layout\"><aside class=\"catalog-sidebar\"><nav class=\"cat-chips\" aria-label=\"防止 AI 味儿\"><button type=\"button\">中文口癖</button><button type=\"button\">页面模板感</button><button type=\"button\">不好用的交互</button></nav></aside><div class=\"grid-wrap\"><header class=\"aif-catalog-heading\"><p>AI 味儿图鉴</p><h1>防止 AI 味儿</h1><div>把常见的 AI 口癖、套模板的页面和不好用的交互当成词条来认。每条都给出原句或原页面、正常用法和具体改法。</div><small>单个词、视觉元素或交互问题不能证明作者。判断时要看它是否与其他默认选择成组出现。</small></header><section class=\"cat-section\" id=\"aif-category-zh\"><div class=\"cat-title aif-cat-title\"><div>中文口癖<small>怪动词、单字动作和固定开场、结尾</small></div><span>11 个表现</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"catch-you\"><a href=\"#aif-catch-you\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>稳稳接住</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">你正常说就行，别再说什么“稳稳接住我”了。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-catch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>稳稳接住</span><p>你不是太敏感，你只是太清醒了。我就在这里，不躲、不藏、不绕，稳稳地接住你。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"single-verbs\"><a href=\"#aif-single-verbs\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>单字动作</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">你怎么老说收一下、提一层、落回去？正常说话不这么说。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-verbs\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>单字动作</span><p>先把问题收紧，把逻辑顺一下，再把结论往上提一层，最后稳稳落住。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"decorative-quotes\"><a href=\"#aif-decorative-quotes\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>什么都要加双引号</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这些词本来就是正常意思，为什么都要特意加个引号？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-quotes\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>什么都要加双引号</span><p>我们先把‘真实’放回产品里，再让‘用户’重新成为体验的主角。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"inflated-metaphors\"><a href=\"#aif-inflated-metaphors\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>动不动就来个夸张比喻</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">就说这个功能解决什么，别又写成灯塔、桥梁、钥匙。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-metaphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>动不动就来个夸张比喻</span><p>它不是一款普通工具，而是一座穿越信息迷雾的灯塔，为每一个迷失在效率洪流中的人照亮前路。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"raise-the-theme\"><a href=\"#aif-raise-the-theme\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>提升立意</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这不就是个会议纪要功能吗？别一下扯到人与人连接那么大。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-elevate\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>提升立意</span><p>它解决的从来不只是会议纪要的效率问题，更是在这个被技术加速的时代，帮我们重新找回人与人之间真实的连接。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"engineering-posture\"><a href=\"#aif-engineering-posture\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>满口砍一刀、收口、闭环</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">你正常说就行，别一开口就是砍一刀、收口、闭环。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-engineering\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>满口砍一刀、收口、闭环</span><p>这版我直接砍一刀：先把逻辑压实，再把结构收口，最后把方案落盘，形成一个最小闭环。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"user-validation\"><a href=\"#aif-user-validation\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>动不动就夸你抓住本质</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">我只是问这个想法行不行，别又说我抓住了本质。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-validate\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>动不动就夸你抓住本质</span><p>你这个判断非常准确，而且已经触及了问题最本质、最关键的那一层。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"not-x-but-y\"><a href=\"#aif-not-x-but-y\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>不是 X，而是 Y</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">直接说这次更新做了什么，别又写成“不是更新，而是重新定义未来”。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-contrast\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>不是 X，而是 Y</span><p>这不是一次简单的产品更新，而是一场关于效率、协作与未来工作方式的重新定义。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"conclusion-first\"><a href=\"#aif-conclusion-first\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>先说结论的套话</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这个问题很简单，直接告诉我答案就行，不用先铺一大段。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-conclusion\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>先说结论的套话</span><p>我先把结论放在前面：你的直觉完全正确。下面我用三点把这件事讲透。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"fragmented-bullets\"><a href=\"#aif-fragmented-bullets\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>每句话都拆成分点</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这几句话明明能顺着说完，为什么又拆成一堆圆点和编号？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-fragmented-bullets\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>每句话都拆成分点</span><p>结论：\n• 能做\n• 速度快\n• 风险低\n1. 先改\n2. 再看\n3. 最后确认</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"if-you-want\"><a href=\"#aif-if-you-want\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>如果你愿意</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">说完就行了，不用每次最后都问我要不要再来一版。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-invite\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>如果你愿意</span><p>如果你愿意，我下一步可以直接给你一版。</p><i></i></div></div></a></article></div></section><section class=\"cat-section\" id=\"aif-category-ui\"><div class=\"cat-title aif-cat-title\"><div>页面模板感<small>反复出现的布局、装饰和通用图标</small></div><span>8 个表现</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"centered-hero\"><a href=\"#aif-centered-hero\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>居中大标题</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">能不能先把产品界面放出来？现在又是一个大标题加两个按钮。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-centered\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><small>AI 驱动</small><strong>重新定义未来</strong><p>团队需要的一切，都在这里。</p><div><i></i><i></i></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"three-equal-cards\"><a href=\"#aif-three-equal-cards\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>三张等宽卡片</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这三个功能明明有主次，为什么都做成一样大的卡片？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-three-cards\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i><b></b><span></span><span></span></i><i><b></b><span></span><span></span></i><i><b></b><span></span><span></span></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"purple-glow\"><a href=\"#aif-purple-glow\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>蓝紫渐变光球</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">怎么又是蓝紫渐变和发光球？这跟我们的品牌没什么关系。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><strong>下一代智能平台</strong><span></span></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"rounded-everything\"><a href=\"#aif-rounded-everything\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>框里再套框</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">外面已经有一个框了，里面怎么又套了三层卡片？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-rounded\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><span>项目概览</span><i><em>本周进度</em><b>已完成 8 项</b></i></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"divider-everywhere\"><a href=\"#aif-divider-everywhere\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>每段都画分割线</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这些内容本来就是一组，为什么每两行之间都要画一条线？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-divider-everywhere\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><strong>通知设置</strong><p><span>邮件通知</span><b>开启</b></p><p><span>产品更新</span><b>关闭</b></p><p><span>每周摘要</span><b>开启</b></p></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"left-border-callouts\"><a href=\"#aif-left-border-callouts\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>左边都要加一条竖线</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这些都是普通说明，为什么每一块左边都要加一条彩色竖线？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-left-border-callouts\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><strong>发布说明</strong><div><p><b>影响范围</b><span>仅当前项目</span></p><p><b>同步时间</b><span>保存完成后</span></p><p><b>发布时间</b><span>周五 18:00</span></p></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"heavy-headline\"><a href=\"#aif-heavy-headline\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>又大又黑又挤</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这个标题又粗又挤，两行字都快贴在一起了，能不能先让它好读一点？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-heavy-headline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><strong>让每一次会议<br>都推动工作向前</strong><p>把录音整理成结论、负责人和待办。</p></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"emoji-icons\"><a href=\"#aif-emoji-icons\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Emoji 当图标</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这些火箭、星星、盾牌看着太模板了，换成正常一点的图标吧。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i><b>🚀</b><span>极速</span></i><i><b>✨</b><span>智能</span></i><i><b>🛡️</b><span>安全</span></i></div></div></a></article></div></section><section class=\"cat-section\" id=\"aif-category-ux\"><div class=\"cat-title aif-cat-title\"><div>不好用的交互<small>同一件事换名字，按钮看着能点却没有结果</small></div><span>6 个表现</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"motion-everywhere\"><a href=\"#aif-motion-everywhere\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>每块都要飞进来</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">我只是往下看内容，为什么每一块都要晃一下才肯出现？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-motion\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>查看本周更新</span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"fake-responsive\"><a href=\"#aif-fake-responsive\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>手机端一路堆到底</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">电脑版的侧栏、表格和按钮全挤成一条长页面，手机上反而更难用了。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-responsive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"aif-phone-bar\"></div><div class=\"aif-phone-side\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"aif-phone-main\"><strong>订单</strong><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><b>查看订单</b></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"description-everywhere\"><a href=\"#aif-description-everywhere\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>到处补说明</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这些分类名已经很清楚了，上面为什么还要再写一段“在这里管理你的知识”？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-sidebar-copy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><strong>工作区</strong><p>在这里管理你的知识、灵感和想法。</p><ul><li class=\"is-current\"><b>最近笔记</b><span>查看你最近打开的笔记</span></li><li><b>项目</b><span>按照项目整理笔记</span></li><li><b>归档</b><span>存放暂时不用的笔记</span></li></ul></div><section><b>最近笔记</b><i></i><i></i><i></i></section></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"naming-drift\"><a href=\"#aif-naming-drift\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>同一操作换着叫</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这里写“新建”，右上角又叫“添加”，打开弹窗以后怎么变成“创建”了？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-naming-drift\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><small>侧栏</small><b>新建笔记</b></div><div><small>空状态</small><b>添加页面</b></div><div><small>弹窗</small><b>创建文档</b></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"inert-controls\"><a href=\"#aif-inert-controls\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>按钮只是摆设</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这个筛选点了什么都不变，那为什么还要把它做得像真的一样？</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-inert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><span>全部</span><span>待处理</span><span>导出</span></div><p>8 项结果</p><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"icon-button-maze\"><a href=\"#aif-icon-button-maze\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>只放图标，不写名字</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">这一排图标我根本不知道哪个是删除，手机上也没法悬停看提示。</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-icon-maze\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>项目操作</p><div><span>✎</span><span>⧉</span><span>↗</span><span>⌁</span><span>×</span></div></div></div></a></article></div></section></div></div></div></main>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/anti-ai-flavor"}